<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>M5 Actors - No Data</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; margin: 20px; }
    .header { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
    .nav { margin: 10px 0; }
    .nav a { margin-right: 15px; text-decoration: none; color: #0066cc; }
    .message { background: #d1ecf1; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; color: #0c5460; border-left: 4px solid #17a2b8; }
    .message h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>M5 Actors</h1>
    <p>Session: <strong><%= @session.id %></strong></p>
    <div class="nav">
      <a href="/">Sessions</a>
      <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>">Transcript</a>
      <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>/tokens">Tokens</a>
      <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>/permissions">Permissions (M5)</a>
      <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>/actors">Actors (M5)</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="message">
    <h2>ℹ️ Audit Database Not Available</h2>
    <p>The audit trail database (<code>.boukensha/events.db</code>) was not found or is not accessible.</p>
    <p>Actors dashboard requires M5 to be enabled in your Boukensha configuration. This feature is used for multi-character control and role-based permission tracking.</p>
    <h3>To enable M5 and track actors:</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Configure your agent with GuardedRegistry and an Actor</li>
      <li>Run your agent with the configured permissions and audit logging</li>
      <li>The audit database will record which actor performed which actions</li>
      <li>Refresh this page to see actor statistics and decision history</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
